      "quotes": [
        {
          "text": "In the examples provided, most of the relationships are implied by having elements nested within other elements. The relationships are still there, just not as explicit. Mapping the relationships between elements is of great importance and the reason it is almost mandatory that a modeling tool is used. The catalog of models is essential to trace interdependency to be able to perform the analysis for business capability planning.",
